title: Consumer skill perl-file-sops could name has_bare_lastmodified
updated: 2026-11-06T21:17:36Z
---

Found while working k207. The consumer skill perl-file-sops says a file with a bare sops.lastmodified only warns on every read until a rotate. Since the public check File::SOPS->has_bare_lastmodified exists, the skill could tell consumers to ask it before rotating instead of matching the warning or the text. Left alone in the 2026-11-06 round because the hub fixed that the consumer skill stays as it is. Done when the skill names the method, its two call forms and rotate as the rewrite.
